{
  "documents": [
    {
      "title": "Agreed website scope",
      "text": "Website build quote\nSeller: Nara Web Studio, Indonesia\nBuyer: Piko Pantry\nPrice: USD 680, paid through PayPal\n\nAgreed deliverables, one requirement per line:\n1. Deliver a five-page website with Home, About, Menu, Contact, and FAQ pages.\n2. Deliver an Indonesian-language version of every page.\n3. Deliver a contact form that sends submissions to the buyer's email address.\n4. Deliver responsive layouts for desktop and mobile screens.\n\nThe buyer will provide the menu text and photographs. The seller will hand over the site files and provide a preview for review. Hosting fees and future content updates are outside this quote."
    },
    {
      "title": "Website handover note",
      "text": "Handover from Nara Web Studio to Piko Pantry\n\nThe delivered package contains five page files: home.html, about.html, menu.html, contact.html, and faq.html. Each file contains the corresponding agreed page content and is linked from the navigation menu.\n\nThe package contains no Indonesian-language pages or translations. Desktop layouts are complete for all five pages. Mobile layouts are complete for Home, About, and Menu; Contact and FAQ have desktop layouts only.\n\nThe contact page contains a form and its processing script. The package does not include a test submission or mail delivery log. The preview uses the same files as the handover package. Hosting setup remains with the buyer."
    },
    {
      "title": "Post-delivery chat",
      "text": "10:04 Piko Pantry: I downloaded the package and found all five page files. Thanks for organizing them by page.\n10:09 Nara Web Studio: Glad the handover arrived. The navigation links are in each page file.\n10:15 Piko Pantry: I see the desktop styling, but Contact and FAQ don't have the mobile styling yet.\n10:20 Nara Web Studio: That's right. Home, About, and Menu have mobile layouts; the other two still need them.\n10:28 Piko Pantry: The Indonesian pages are absent too. Please tell me when you can supply them.\n10:34 Nara Web Studio: I haven't delivered those translations. I'll send a revised schedule tomorrow.\n10:41 Piko Pantry: I haven't tested the contact form or checked for a received message yet."
    }
  ],
  "hypotheses": [
    {
      "text": "Deliver a five-page website with Home, About, Menu, Contact, and FAQ pages.",
      "value": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Deliver an Indonesian-language version of every page.",
      "value": null
